# Copy to /srv/autob2b/secrets.env on the host, then:
#   chown root:root /srv/autob2b/secrets.env
#   chmod 600 /srv/autob2b/secrets.env
# Create that file before the first `docker compose up`.
# Generate a new administrator password of at least 4 characters (longer is allowed).
# Do not reuse either password that was published in an older AutoB2B commit, or a password from email, a ticket, or chat.
# Only the keys below are accepted. Values are not written to the app log.
# If a value contains spaces or #, it may be wrapped in double quotes.
# A buy stays closed until all three SELLER_ lines are present and valid.
# Do not add a seller email or phone key. Public seller contact is not selected.
# HEAD_ADMIN_EMAILS does not rewrite users. The owner is BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL unless OWNER_EMAIL is set.
# SELLER_LEGAL_NAME is the name published for this CVR. It was not read from datacvr.virk.dk.
# SELLER_ADDRESS is the street line supplied by the owner. The website visiting line "2-4" is not used.

BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL=
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_NAME=Administrator
# Optional. The owner is the account with BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL, unless OWNER_EMAIL is set.
# HEAD_ADMIN_EMAILS is a comma-separated list. jan@jan.dk is hovedadmin at runtime.
# Startup does not change any user row because of these keys.
# OWNER_EMAIL=
HEAD_ADMIN_EMAILS=jan@jan.dk
SELLER_LEGAL_NAME=Højbogaard Biler
SELLER_CVR=14952705
SELLER_ADDRESS=Teknologiparken 4, 9440 Aabybro, Denmark
